/Title (Weekly totals use slicing r[i:i+7]. 365 = 52 x 7 + 1, so there are 52 full weeks plus a 1-day final slice \(the slice simply returns fewer items at the end, no error\). Maximum and minimum use max\(\), min\(\) and index\(\). The dry days are the indices where the reading is 0. Full program \(also contains the experiments\):)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 559 0 R
