/Title (Naive \(re-add every window\): each window adds 7 numbers = 6 additions, so total = 6\(n - 6\) additions, i.e. O\(kn\) = O\(7n\) = O\(n\).)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 509 0 R
/Prev 562 0 R
/Next 630 0 R
>>
endobj
630 0 obj
<<
/Title (Running sum: first window = 6 additions. Each of the remaining n - 7 windows needs 1 addition and 1 subtraction. Total = 6 + \(n - 7\) = n - 1 additions plus n - 7 subtractions = 2n - 8 operations, and O\(n\) time with a constant independent of k.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 509 0 R
/Prev 629 0 R
/Next 563 0 R
>>
