/Title (and for the next 10 times rise \(to 365,000\) it rises about 8 times, i.e. roughly proportional to n, confirming O\(n\) for both methods \(small n is dominated by call overhead and cache effects\). The measured gap of about 3 to 3.6 times matches the predicted 3:1 operation ratio; the small excess comes from the naive version creating a new 7-element slice and calling sum\(\) on every window.)
