750 0 obj
<<
/Title (Conclusion: all approaches are O\(n\) in time; the running sum removes the factor 7 \(the window size\). The deque gives the smallest memory for streaming data, while the dictionary gives the easiest handling of late or missing dates at the cost of memory.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 705 0 R
/Prev 769 0 R
>>
endobj
