/Title (Stops are tuples \(immutable, hashable\) used as dictionary keys. The grid is created with a list comprehension so that each row is a separate list. Aliasing, shallow copy \(copy.copy, slicing\) and deep copy \(copy.deepcopy\) are demonstrated, and tuples are unpacked in the for loop \(for \(lat, lon\), name in stops.items\(\)\).)
